WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.501
A brand new report is raising

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.669
some serious questions

00:00:02.669 --> 00:00:03.436
about Supreme Court

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:05.372
Justice Clarence Thomas

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:06.373
and the lavish gifts

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:07.874
that he reportedly accepted

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:09.809
from a GOP megadonor

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:12.278
ProPublica says that a luxury vacations

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:12.879
from billionaire

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:15.849
Harlan Crow were never disclosed.

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.951
And according to these

00:00:17.951 --> 00:00:18.651
ProPublica,

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:20.653
these are photos of Clarence Thomas

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.355
and his wife, Ginni Thomas,

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:23.656
with Crow and others

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:26.559
during a trip to Indonesia back in 2019.

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:27.894
The report says that

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:29.362
the Thomas flew on Crows

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:30.263
private jet

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:32.198
to Indonesia for the nine day

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:33.600
luxury vacation.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.567
One that they say

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.704
is valued at more than $500,000.

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.973
Now ProPublica goes on to say that

00:00:39.973 --> 00:00:41.007
the extent

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:42.175
and frequency of Crowe's

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:43.710
apparent gifts to Thomas

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:44.778
have no known

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:46.746
precedent in the modern history

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:48.848
of the United States Supreme Court.

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:49.382
And just minutes

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:50.784
ago, Senate Majority

00:00:50.784 --> 00:00:53.253
Whip Dick Durbin had this to say, quote,

00:00:53.453 --> 00:00:54.721
The ProPublica report

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:56.289
is a call to action,

00:00:56.289 --> 00:00:56.790
and the Senate

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:59.125
Judiciary Committee will act

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:00.293
CNN Supreme Court

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:02.495
reporter Ariane de Vogue is joining us

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:05.165
now with more on this very eyebrow

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:06.299
raising story.

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:07.867
So, Arianna, how unprecedented

00:01:07.867 --> 00:01:09.102
is this really

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:13.306
It's unheard of at the Supreme Court.

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:16.342
This ProPublica report really detailing

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:17.977
these lavish trips

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:18.511
that Justice

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:20.513
Clarence Thomas took and were paid for

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:21.714
by this mega

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:22.682
donor and trips,

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:23.450
like you said, New

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:26.086
Zealand, Indonesia on private jets,

00:01:26.486 --> 00:01:29.089
private yachts at private resorts.

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:30.390
But what's really important

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:32.325
here is to put this into context,

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:33.193
because it comes

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:34.627
as the Supreme Court right now

00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:36.930
is under this white-Hot spotlight,

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:38.832
where more and more people are thinking

00:01:38.832 --> 00:01:39.466
that the court

00:01:39.466 --> 00:01:40.133
has becoming

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:42.502
more political, less the judicial branch,

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:45.738
more like just another political branch.

00:01:46.039 --> 00:01:47.373
And you see Congress

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:48.575
right now, it's moving.

00:01:48.575 --> 00:01:50.610
It wants more ethics disclosure.

00:01:50.844 --> 00:01:52.312
He himself,

00:01:52.312 --> 00:01:55.115
Thomas, is arguably the most conservative

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:56.015
member of the court.

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:57.750
And, of course, his wife, Ginni

00:01:57.750 --> 00:02:00.019
Thomas, came under fire

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:01.087
several months ago

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:01.888
for texts

00:02:01.888 --> 00:02:04.757
that she sent to members of Trump's team

00:02:05.191 --> 00:02:06.860
in an effort to overturn

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:07.994
election results.

00:02:07.994 --> 00:02:09.662
So this is all coming

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:11.297
when the Supreme Court

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:12.198
is in the middle

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:14.501
of this swirling controversy.

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:16.069
And it

00:02:16.069 --> 00:02:18.805
it causes trouble for Clarence Thomas

00:02:18.805 --> 00:02:19.772
and of course,

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:20.673
what they're saying

00:02:20.673 --> 00:02:22.275
now is Harlan Crow,

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:24.177
this Dallas businessman.

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:26.212
He was the one who paid for this.

00:02:26.212 --> 00:02:28.348
It was never disclosed.

00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:29.816
And he is given more,

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:31.251
according to ProPublica,

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:32.785
than $10 million

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:33.586
in political

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:34.988
contributions over the years.

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:37.557
Yeah, I mean, that's really stunning.

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:38.158
So, Ari, on

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:39.125
what has Harlan Crow

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:41.227
said about all of this.

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:43.530
Well, he did release a statement

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:44.797
that we got a copy of.

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:46.266
He said we have never asked

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:48.268
about a pending or lower court case.

00:02:48.268 --> 00:02:48.801
And Justice

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.637
Thomas has never discussed one.

00:02:50.637 --> 00:02:52.772
And we have never sought to influence

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:53.106
Justice

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:56.709
Thomas on any legal or political issue.

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:57.710
He says he's

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.379
unaware of any of our friends

00:02:59.379 --> 00:03:01.548
ever lobbying or seeking

00:03:01.548 --> 00:03:03.483
to influence Justice Thomas.

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:04.184
But the thing is,

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:05.418
it really does

00:03:05.418 --> 00:03:07.187
put a spotlight on ethics

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:08.521
at the Supreme Court,

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:10.190
because the judicial conference

00:03:10.190 --> 00:03:12.725
just recently amended its own rules,

00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:14.194
and it would cover things

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:16.963
like staying in a private resort,

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.131
private jets.

00:03:18.131 --> 00:03:19.933
It said that those things

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:21.568
have to be disclosed.

00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:22.869
So maybe arguably,

00:03:22.869 --> 00:03:24.837
Thomas could say, look, before that,

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:26.206
they didn't need to be disclosed.

00:03:26.206 --> 00:03:27.507
So I didn't have to disclose it.

00:03:27.507 --> 00:03:29.976
But there's also federal law in place.

00:03:29.976 --> 00:03:32.178
And it says that members of the judiciary

00:03:32.545 --> 00:03:34.914
should not accept anything of value

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:36.115
from a person

00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:36.983
whose interests

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:38.851
may be substantially affected.

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:40.220
Again, language

00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:41.354
that might suggest

00:03:41.354 --> 00:03:42.822
that this kind of trip,

00:03:42.822 --> 00:03:44.157
this kind of money

00:03:44.157 --> 00:03:46.159
should have been disclosed.

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:47.760
Now, Clarence, Thomas

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:48.728
or neither

00:03:48.728 --> 00:03:49.295
Clarence Thomas

00:03:49.295 --> 00:03:50.563
or the Supreme Court

00:03:50.563 --> 00:03:51.898
has decided

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:54.234
to give any kind of statement right now,

00:03:54.334 --> 00:03:56.402
but it comes as all eyes are

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:57.704
on the Supreme Court.

00:03:59.072 --> 00:03:59.973
Yeah, absolutely.

00:03:59.973 --> 00:04:00.907
And as you said,

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:01.741
the federal law talks

00:04:01.741 --> 00:04:03.209
about anything of value.

00:04:03.209 --> 00:04:05.011
These are a lot of very valuable things.

00:04:05.011 --> 00:04:06.446
I think most people would agree

00:04:06.446 --> 00:04:07.780
with that. Ari Devoe.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:08.648
Thank you very much.

